    <p>
      The fertilizer voucher story in this chapter is a labelled hypothetical,
      not a documented case, and so has no citation.
      It is built around the real structure of Kenya's e-voucher fertilizer
      subsidy programme (registration through NCPB and partner agents,
      SMS-based voucher redemption), but the specific failure described is
      illustrative rather than reported.
